 workit:{l:'riki',r:'mom',setup:[['B','Time to clean your room.','neutral']],bad:[['A','No way! You can’t make me!','upset'],['B','Then no playdate today.','sad','Why won’t she even talk to me about it?']],good:[['A','I want to finish my drawing first. Can we make a deal?','think'],['B','My worry is the room won’t get clean. What’s your idea?','neutral','She asked nicely. I can listen to her idea.'],['A','I’ll finish my drawing, then clean for 10 minutes!','happy'],['B','Deal! That works for both of us.','excited']],q:'Which way ended with a deal that worked for both?'},
